<title>JAPAN: TOKAI KONETSU KOGYO - 6MTH PARENT RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TOKAI KONETSU KOGYO - 6MTH PARENT RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-08-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1997</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  3.10		vs	    2.72</p>
<p> Operating	   73    million    vs	   43    million</p>
<p> Current	     77    million    vs	   67    million</p>
<p> Net		   43    million    vs	   43    million</p>
<p> EPS		    2.54 yen	  vs	    2.58 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     17 million	  vs	  17 million</p>
<p> Interim div	   nil		vs	     nil</p>
<p>NOTE - Tokai Konetsu Kogyo Co Ltd is a large maker of silicon carbide heating elements and heating equipment. Its net was unchanged.</p>
</text>
